# the same functions with handlers withheld: the poll of the head throws what is owed, under the handler of the head, and no poll stands in front of the loop
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK: isLoopHead=true handler=
# CHECK: = LoopHint
# RUN(NEVER): walk f1 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations
# NEVER-NOT: throwsOwedError
# NEVER-NOT: LeavesOwedError
# PROGRAM-OF: poll-of-a-loop-leaves-the-handler-around-the-loop.ir
